ription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":344,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:11Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-26T12:36:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T00:20:46Z","closed_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis code exists in `RenderGeometryInstanceBase::set_transform`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nnon_uniform_scale = max_scale >= 0.0 && (min_scale / max_scale) < 0.999;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis code is wrong for 2 reasons:\r\n\r\n1) If `max_scale` equals zero, then `/ max_scale` will fail, as shown by this sanitizer error:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nservers/rendering/renderer_geometry_instance.cpp:78:53: runtime error: division by zero\r\n```\r\n\r\n2) The check `max_scale >= 0.0` does not make any sense due to how the value originates. The value gets distilled from `.get_scale_abs()`. The comparison `abs(x) >= 0.0` will always be true (except for NaN).\r\n\r\nFor both of these reasons, surely `>` was intended. This PR fixes it by changing `>=` to `>`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI to search for fixes to runtime errors on the godot-dimensions CI, and I am verifying each one as I submit upstream. This one is... very trivial, but I still checked anyway.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122841/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122841/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}